          "message": "docs(skill): record the logq levers\n\nThe select-unswitch trap (LLVM cloning a Horner chain behind a 50/50\nsign branch), the normalized-discarded-field rounding pattern, and the\napproximate-high-product + wider-gate latency trade with its Estrin\nfollow-up, each with the measured deltas from the logq campaign\n(1.20x -> 1.00x).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
