          "distinct": true,
          "id": "b3af6b9b34105a33e67beb2a243c1a7fd27c634c",
          "message": "Link every integration test into one binary under tests/all\n\nEach file under tests/ was its own crate and its own link of the\nlibrary plus core-math-sys; 109 of them.  tests/all/main.rs now\ndeclares them as modules under f32_/, f64_/ and f128_/, so the\nsuite links once and runs across files in parallel.  The nesting\nis deliberate: CI shards by the anchored filter '::<fn>::', which\nkeeps the sin shard from also selecting asin.  Shared helpers move\nto tests/all/common.rs and are plain `use crate::common` imports;\nthe f128 helpers keep their common128/common_exp names.",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-02T14:39:33+08:00",
